#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/filter1d.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.filter1d.filter1d:3
msgid ""
"A general time domain filter for multiple column time series data. The user "
"specifies which column is the time (i.e., the independent variable) via "
"``time_col``. The fastest operation occurs when the input time series are "
"equally spaced and have no gaps or outliers and the special options are not "
"needed. Read a table and output as a :class:`numpy.ndarray`, :class:`pandas."
"DataFrame`, or ASCII file."
msgstr ""

